EduSpace Team,

Per action item from OAC Meeting #10, attached is our Phase 2 abatement plan for the Lincoln High School Renovation.

Scope of Phase 2 abatement:
- 2nd floor ceiling plenum ACM (identified in supplemental survey dated Jan 2024)
- 1st floor mechanical room pipe insulation (TSI)
- Basement boiler room gaskets and packing

Key dates:
- Abatement start: June 17, 2024 (first day of summer break)
- Abatement completion: July 12, 2024 (4 weeks)
- Air monitoring/clearance: July 15-17, 2024
- Renovation work resumes: July 22, 2024

The plan includes:
1. Work area preparation and containment details
2. Negative air requirements and HEPA filtration
3. Worker protection and medical surveillance
4. Waste characterization and disposal plan
5. Air monitoring protocol (PCM and TEM analysis)
6. Third-party clearance testing by Apex Environmental

This plan has been reviewed by our licensed abatement contractor (EnviroSafe LLC) and meets all OSHA, EPA, and Oregon DEQ requirements.

PPS - we'll need the building to be unoccupied during the abatement period. Can you confirm the summer schedule allows for this?

